      "text": "Teotihuacán and the Basilica of Guadalupe"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "4ad21611aa158f438ebe15e37ee061e94e0774a570f9c95dd3bccec768ea0ba6",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-d1461c91bf6a",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Today you will visit Teotihuacán to see the Pyramids of the Sun and Moon, the Avenue of the Dead and the architecture of the ancient city. From the archaeological site, continue to the Basilica of Our Lady of Guadalupe. The itinerary visits Teotihuacán first and the basilica second. Return to Mexico City and relax at the hotel. Guided excursions on this tour are conducted in English. The departure time will be agreed in advance."
